/o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"301"  height=3D"181"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-206.png" ><img width=3D"289"  height=3D"211"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-207.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"747"  height=3D"288"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-209.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >最后点击&#8221;finish按钮&#8220;安装完毕后，接下来就是进入FMS软件进行校正设置了。请跟随下面的步骤进行：&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"552"  height=3D"370"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-264.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >第一步&nbsp;控制-&#62;模拟控制&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"324"  height=3D"227"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-280.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >第二步&nbsp;选择&#8220;游戏杆接口&#8221;，再点&#8220;映射/校准&#8221;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"480"  height=3D"337"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-306.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >第三步&nbsp;将映射设置为图上的参数&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; color:rgb(0,0,0); font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >(这个参数是应对天地飞06A的，如果是其它的遥控器则要依据实际情况设置)。USB带摇杆模拟器的朋友，可以参考下图来设置：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; color:rgb(8,0,0); font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; color:rgb(8,0,0); font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><img width=3D"870"  height=3D"341"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-387.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >第四步&nbsp;映射设置完后点&#8220;校准&#8221;，于是出现了以下界面&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><img width=3D"484"  height=3D"332"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-417.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >第五步&nbsp;请按界面上的要求拨动摇杆，直到涉及所有范围&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >此时杆位可以是任意的，然后点&#8220;下一步&#8221;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><img width=3D"483"  height=3D"335"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-466.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><img width=3D"555"  height=3D"371"  src=3D"~tmp1396163522.files/~tmp1396163522-468.png" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >摔了飞机以后，按键盘的&#8220;i&#8221;键就可以重新开始了。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:10.5000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:left; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"text-indent:21.0000pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; text-align:justify; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

